form4.spinedit7.hint="Hit points of all players that are not in the handicap table."
form4.spinedit6.hint="After a hit that is not lethal the player is invulnerable for this time, so the same flame does not hit twice."
form4.spinedit5.hint="Longest invulnerable time. The time is random between min. and max."
form4.spinedit4.hint="Shortest invulnerable time. The time is random between min. and max."
form4.spinedit36.hint="How long a bomb has to stay in the beam without a break until it is ignited. 0 = at once."
