form6.combobox3.hint="Who wins the round. A tie is a draw."
form6.combobox3.items[0]="Longest time as hunted"
form6.combobox3.items[1]="Most kills of the hunted"
form6.combobox3.items[2]="Hunted at round end"
form6.label9.caption="The old hunted gets"
form6.combobox4.hint="What the old hunted starts with after his respawn: his items from before he became the hunted (they are not spread on the field when he dies), or only the start values of the scheme."
form6.combobox4.items[0]="His items from before"
form6.combobox4.items[1]="No items (scheme)"
form6.label10.caption="Invulnerable as new hunted (ms)"
form6.spinedit1.hint="A player who becomes the hunted blinks and is invulnerable for this time, 0 = not at all."
form6.checkbox1.caption="Respawn: dead players come back"
form6.checkbox1.hint="On: dead players come back after the waiting time, the round ends when the play time is over. There is no hurry then.~0Off: the normal rules, the round ends when only one player is left."
form6.label11.caption="Respawn after (ms)"
form6.spinedit2.hint="Waiting time until a dead player comes back."
form6.label12.caption="Invulnerable after respawn (ms)"
form6.spinedit3.hint="A player who comes back blinks and is invulnerable for this time."
form6.checkbox2.caption="The hunted gets no diseases"
form6.checkbox2.hint="On: diseases, slow and swap have no effect on the hunted, he does not get infected."
form6.checkbox3.caption="Gold color"
form6.checkbox3.hint="On: the hunted is drawn in gold."
form6.checkbox4.caption="Aura"
form6.checkbox4.hint="On: a pulsing aura is drawn around the hunted."
form6.checkbox5.caption="The hunted sees his aura"
form6.checkbox5.hint="On: the hunted also sees his own aura. Off: only the hunters see it (two players on one PC always see it)."
form6.label13.caption="Team play is on, the hunter mode is ignored in team play."
form6.label14.caption="Ghosts only work without respawn."
form6.label15.caption="Changes apply to the next game started on this PC."
form6.label16.caption="Manual"
form6.label16.hint="Open the manual of the game options and game modes (GAMEOPTIONS_MANUAL.md, with a link to the German version)."
form6.button1.caption="&Defaults"
form6.button1.hint="Reset the game mode to its default values (Classic). The mods stay as they are. Saved only with OK."
form6.button2.caption="OK"
form6.button2.hint="Save the game mode to atomic_mods.ini. It applies to the next game this PC joins as first player, also on another server."
form6.button3.caption="Cancel"
form6.button3.hint="Close without saving."
